TYPE=u32
GROUP=dolt
DOC=store-persist compact bounds each database's commit log to this many commits: the oldest are squashed into one base, the live store is collected in full, and the durable copy is rebuilt, because commit history is what holds the store's space (about 40 KB per commit); 0 keeps all history.
SCHEMA=Commits of history compact leaves per database (default 10000; 0 keeps all; 1 is refused).
DEFAULT<<'SPIRA_CONF_DEFAULT_EOF'
    : "${SPIRA_DOLT_PERSIST_HISTORY_KEEP:=10000}"
SPIRA_CONF_DEFAULT_EOF
